{"translation-revision-date":"YEAR-MO-DA HO:MI+ZONE","generator":"WP-CLI\/2.12.0","source":"build\/tool.js","domain":"messages","locale_data":{"messages":{"":{"domain":"messages","lang":"en_GB","plural-forms":"nplurals=2; plural=(n != 1);"},"AI labels":[""],"AI labels are loading \u2026":[""],"Check on the site":[""],"Modified with AI":[""],"AI-generated":[""],"This image was created with AI.":[""],"This image was modified with AI.":[""],"No label needed":[""],"Suggestion":[""],"Labeled":["Labelled"],"Suggestions":[""],"Used, not decided":[""],"Not decided":[""],"Site icon":[""],"Header image":[""],"That did not work.":[""],"set up":[""],"API key missing":[""],"not responding":[""],"plugin missing":[""],"Update WordPress":[""],"Set up an AI provider first":[""],"Open Connectors":[""],"Install Vercel AI Gateway":[""],"No contract with a provider? Vercel AI Gateway gives $5 a month free, no credit card.":[""],"Review":[""],"Appearance":[""],"Knowledge":[""],"Article 50 of the AI Regulation (EU) 2024\/1689":[""],"AI Act Art. 50 applies since 2 Aug 2026":[""],"AI Act Art. 50":[""],"Media Library":[""],"Photorealistic AI \u201cteam photo\u201d, customer portrait, testimonial":[""],"Real photo, background or person replaced or added with AI":[""],"AI product shot that looks like a real photo of the product":[""],"AI image of a real building, place or event":[""],"Recognizable illustration, comic, 3D graphic, abstract background":["Recognisable illustration, comic, 3D graphic, abstract background"],"Real photo, only color, light, noise or crop with an AI tool":["Real photo, only colour, light, noise or crop with an AI tool"],"Camera or stock photo without AI":[""],"required":[""],"voluntary":[""],"no label":[""],"Questions and answers on Article 50 (European Commission)":[""],"Code of Practice on labeling AI-generated content":["Code of Practice on labelling AI-generated content"],"The EU icons to download":[""],"AI Act in the Official Journal (Regulation (EU) 2024\/1689)":[""],"AI Act Service Desk":[""],"AI Act, Article 50":[""],"Since 2 August 2026, what AI made has to be visible.":[""],"A business that publishes images, videos or recordings that look real but were created or modified with AI has to label them \u2013 visibly, at the latest at first sight. The duty is yours as the site owner, not the AI tool maker's.":[""],"You have to label":[""],"Deepfakes: AI images, videos, audio that show real or plausible people, things, places or events and look real \u2013 also an invented but photorealistic person.":[""],"AI texts that inform the public on matters of public interest \u2013 unless a person reviewed them and takes responsibility.":[""],"Whether you meant to deceive does not matter. What your audience believes counts.":[""],"No label needed for":[""],"Ordinary editing: crop, light, color, noise, dust, upscaling \u2013 also with AI tools.":["Ordinary editing: crop, light, colour, noise, dust, upscaling \u2013 also with AI tools."],"Obviously artificial images (illustration, comic, abstract): voluntary, but good for trust.":[""],"Content created before 2 August 2026 \u2013 nothing applies retroactively.":[""],"Art, satire, fiction: yes, but so that the work does not suffer (e.g. in the caption).":[""],"Where the label goes":[""],"On or right at the content, visible without a click \u2013 not only in the imprint.":[""],"Plain words: \u201cAI-generated\u201d, \u201cModified with AI\u201d. For screen readers as the icon's name, never instead of the alt text.":[""],"Videos: in a corner the whole time. Audio: at the player and in the artwork.":[""],"The AI tool's watermark or metadata does not count for you.":[""],"The EU's icons":[""],"From the Commission since June 2026, free to use, no attribution. Optional \u2013 an equivalent label is allowed too.":[""],"AI GENERATED":[""],"Fully created with AI, no human-made parts.":[""],"AI MODIFIED":[""],"Real photo, video or recording, partly modified with AI.":[""],"The basic icon: with your own text, with a second layer or where space is short.":[""],"Typical cases":[""],"File":[""],"Kind":[""],"Label":[""],"How the plugin recognizes AI":["How the plugin recognises AI"],"Many AI tools write into the file that it was made with AI: Content Credentials (C2PA) from ChatGPT, Gemini, Firefly or Photoshop, the IPTC value \u201ctrainedAlgorithmicMedia\u201d, the generation data of Stable Diffusion and ComfyUI. The plugin reads them on upload and with every check \u2013 on your server, nothing leaves it.":[""],"A missing trace means nothing: screenshots, exports and image optimizers remove them. That is why \u201cUsed, not decided\u201d shows everything visible on your site that has no decision yet. Only you know for sure how an image was made.":["A missing trace means nothing: screenshots, exports and image optimisers remove them. That is why \u201cUsed, not decided\u201d shows everything visible on your site that has no decision yet. Only you know for sure how an image was made."],"This knowledge as a skill":[""],"View SKILL.md":[""],"Sources":[""],"As of 9 October 2026. This is help, not legal advice.":[""],"EU icon by kind":[""],"Round EU icon":[""],"Own icon":[""],"Sparkle":[""],"Top left":[""],"Top right":[""],"Bottom left":[""],"Bottom right":[""],"How it looks on the site":[""],"Modified":[""],"Our workshop in autumn":[""],"Hover over the icon: the second layer shows the notice. Screen readers read it as the icon's name \u2013 the image's alt text stays as it is.":[""],"Choose your own icon":[""],"Administrators change the appearance. You can still label.":[""],"Icon":[""],"The default is the European Commission's icons \u2013 free to use, no attribution.":[""],"Choose another icon":[""],"Your own mark is allowed if it is as clear as the EU icon. The EU icon is the safer choice.":[""],"Color":["Colour"],"Size":[""],"Corner":[""],"Videos: always at the top, away from the controls.":[""],"Words":[""],"Leave empty: the default in the site's language.":[""],"Notice for AI-generated":[""],"Notice for modified":[""],"Where the label appears":[""],"Images in pages and posts":[""],"Blocks, galleries, covers, classic editor, HTML":[""],"Featured images and the theme's images":[""],"everything that comes through wp_get_attachment_image()":[""],"Videos":[""],"Video block, cover with video, [video]":[""],"Audio":[""],"a line above the player":[""],"Notice in captions":[""],"Only where there is one already \u2013 never in the alt text.":[""],"Second layer on hover":[""],"The whole notice, with the tool.":[""],"On upload":[""],"Check files for traces of AI":[""],"C2PA, IPTC, generation data, file names \u2013 on your server.":[""],"Apply unambiguous traces right away":[""],"If the file itself says it was made with AI, it is labeled right away.":["If the file itself says it was made with AI, it is labelled right away."],"Featured image":[""],"Image":[""],"Gallery":[""],"Cover":[""],"Media & Text":[""],"Video":[""],"only as a URL":[""],"Page builder":[""],"ACF field":[""],"Product gallery":[""],"Logo":[""],"Label required":[""],"Label voluntary":[""],"no label needed":[""],"unclear":[""],"Not found on any page":[""],"and %d more":[""],"All":[""],"No file carries traces of AI without a decision. Traces are often missing \u2013 go through \u201cUsed, not decided\u201d too.":[""],"Everything used on your site has a decision. Or the site has not been checked yet.":[""],"No file labeled yet.":["No file labelled yet."],"No file decided as needing no label yet.":[""],"No images, videos or recordings.":[""],"Reading your pages and posts \u2026":[""],"Reading the traces in your files \u2026":[""],"Done.":[""],"labeled":["labelled"],"%1$d AI-generated \u00b7 %2$d modified":[""],"traces of AI, no decision":[""],"used, not decided":[""],"visible on your site":[""],"Last checked %1$s: %2$d pages and posts, %3$d files in use.":[""],"Not checked yet: where your media is used and which traces of AI it carries.":[""],"Check again":[""],"Check site":[""],"not on the page":[""],"page not reachable":[""],"Media":[""],"Decide per file: AI-generated, modified with AI or no label needed. The label is required when something looks real that did not happen that way.":[""],"Search":[""],"Search media":[""],"Apply all %d suggestions":[""],"%d suggestions applied.":[""],"Undo":[""],"Loading \u2026":[""],"Page %1$d of %2$d":[""],"Also in the Media Library: the \u201cAI\u201d filter, a column and bulk actions in the list view.":[""],"Open Media Library":[""],"Close":[""],"as recommended":[""],"changed":[""],"name of the EU basic icon\u0004AI":[""],"Round icon, opens on hover":[""],"Dark":[""],"Light":[""],"Pick a color":["Pick a colour"],"Transparency":[""],"Of the shape; the letters stay solid.":[""],"%d%%":[""],"On small images (under 400 px) the plugin uses the round icon instead of the wide one.":[""],"Image analysis (AI) needs WordPress 7.0":[""],"From 7.0, the image analysis uses the AI provider you set up under Settings \u203a Connectors. Labeling, the check and the traces in files already work.":["From 7.0, the image analysis uses the AI provider you set up under Settings \u203a Connectors. Labelling, the check and the traces in files already work."],"The image analysis uses the provider you set up in WordPress under Settings \u203a Connectors \u2013 your API key stays there. Labeling, the check and the traces in files work without it.":["The image analysis uses the provider you set up in WordPress under Settings \u203a Connectors \u2013 your API key stays there. Labelling, the check and the traces in files work without it."],"The image analysis thinks with a skill: a guide to the AI Act with sources, in the plugin under skills\/eu-ai-act-labels. You can give the same files to any AI agent that reads Agent Skills \u2013 Claude, Cursor, Codex and others.":[""],"Analyze image (AI)":["Analyse image (AI)"],"Analyzing \u2026 %1$d of %2$d":["Analysing \u2026 %1$d of %2$d"],"Analyze %d image (AI)":["Analyse %d image